e side - so the number is the only thing that does.","The maker lists this as its own product, and prints the same name on CLC001. Nothing on file separates them - no colour, no year, no drive side - so the number is the only thing that does.","Another maker carries the same name: 22450 (Welly), 43616 (Welly), 52240 (Welly). Different makers model the same real car, so these are separate releases and the catalogue each one belongs to is what tells them apart.","The maker lists this as its own product, and prints the same name on CLC080, CLC154. Nothing on file separates them - no colour, no year, no drive side - so the number is the only thing that does.","The maker lists this as its own product, and prints the same name on CLC043. Nothing on file separates them - no colour, no year, no drive side - so the number is the only thing that does.","The maker lists this as its own product, and prints the same name on CLC039. Nothing on file separates them - no colour, no year, no drive side - so the number is the only thing that does.","Another maker carries the same name: 52443 (Welly). Different makers model the same real car, so these are separate releases and the catalogue each one belongs to is what tells them apart.","The maker lists this as its own product, and prints the same name on CLC028, CLC154. Nothing on file separates them - no colour, no year, no drive side - so the number is the only thing that does.","The maker lists this as its own product, and prints the same name on CLC028, CLC080. Nothing on file separates them - no colour, no year, no drive side - so the number is the only thing that does."]}}}